## 5. Usage Example

Here is how a user would interact with this module in their application:

```rust
fn main() {
    let config_content = r#"# Database Configuration
host = localhost
port = 5432

# Application Settings
debug_mode = true
log_level = info
"#;

    match Config::parse(config_content) {
        Ok(config) => {
            println!("Parsed {} entries:", config.entries.len());
            for (key, value) in &config.entries {
